30:["$","p","p-1",{"children":"For Dammam city and Al Khobar, give us the exact address — distances vary a lot across the metro area."}]
31:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"arriving-at-king-fahd-international-airport-dmm","children":"Arriving at King Fahd International Airport (DMM)"}]
32:["$","p","p-2",{"children":["DMM is north-west of the Dammam–Khobar area and serves the whole region. Share your ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"flight number"}]," when you book and we check it before pickup. If you are going straight to a site, tell us — luggage, timing and gate details all matter. See ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/airports/king-fahd-dammam","children":"Dammam Airport transfers"}],"."]}]
33:["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"whats-different-about-business-visits-here","children":"What's different about business visits here"}]
34:["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"site-access","children":"Site access"}]
35:["$","p","p-3",{"children":["Industrial sites, company compounds and university campuses often have controlled gates, visitor badges and specific entry points. Share the ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"gate or entrance name, your host's contact and any visitor reference"}]," when you book, so the driver goes to the right place first time."]}]
36:["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"long-days-many-stops","children":"Long days, many stops"}]
37:["$","p","p-4",{"children":["A typical day might be hotel → site in Dhahran → office in Al Khobar → dinner. Booked per trip, that is several separate pickups; booked ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"by the hour or by the day"}],", one driver waits and follows the schedule. See ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/private-driver-cost-saudi-arabia","children":"private driver pricing explained"}],"."]}]
38:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"multi-day-projects","children":"Multi-day projects"}]
39:["$","p","p-5",{"children":"For teams on site for a week or more, book the whole period together. One quote covers the daily pattern (morning drop-offs, evening returns, the airport at either end), and changes are handled with one contact."}]
3a:["$","h3","h3-3",{"id":"coming-from-riyadh","children":"Coming from Riyadh"}]
3b:["$","p","p-6",{"children":"Many executives combine Riyadh and the Eastern Province. The road from Riyadh to Dammam is about 410 km — roughly four hours — which can be a better use of time than a short flight once airport time is counted, especially for a team with equipment."}]
3c:["$","h3","h3-4",{"id":"bahrain","children":"Bahrain"}]
3d:["$","p","p-7",{"children":["Dammam and Al Khobar are close to the causeway to Bahrain, so short cross-border trips are common. You carry your own valid documents; see ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/routes/dammam-to-manama","children":"Dammam to Manama"}],"."]}]
3e:["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"choosing-vehicles","children":"Choosing vehicles"}]
3f:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Executive sedan"}]," for one or two people."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Full-size SUV"}]," for small teams, or when sites have rough access roads."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Van or coaster"}]," for crews and project teams — see ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/fleet","children":"vehicle classes"}],"."]}],"\n"]}]
40:["$","h2","h2-5",{"id":"for-companies","children":"For companies"}]
41:["$","p","p-8",{"children":["Send the sites, dates and expected movements and we return a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"written fixed quote"}],". Payment is by cash to the driver or bank transfer, electronic receipts are available, and company invoices can be issued on request — corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company. Bookings can be cancelled free of charge up to 24 hours before pickup."]}]
42:["$","h2","h2-6",{"id":"common-questions","children":"Common questions"}]
43:["$","h3","h3-5",{"id":"how-far-is-dammam-airport-from-dhahran","children":"How far is Dammam Airport from Dhahran?"}]
44:["$","p","p-9",{"children":"About 25 km — around 25 minutes."}]
45:["$","h3","h3-6",{"id":"how-far-is-jubail-from-dammam-airport","children":"How far is Jubail from Dammam Airport?"}]
46:["$","p","p-10",{"children":"About 90 km — just over an hour."}]
